# Round 8-16A — runtime data, never build input. Without this, `COPY . .`
# baked every stored inspection photo into the image (34 files / 32 MiB at
# the time this was found): image bloat plus a stale copy of user data that
# a fresh named volume would then be seeded from. Photos belong in the
# srm-fieldinspect-media volume; the Dockerfile pre-creates the (empty)
# directory so that volume still inherits app:app ownership.
var/
